{
    "title": "Blinkist: Book Summaries Daily",
    "description": "<b>A WORLD OF KNOWLEDGE IN YOUR POCKET</b>\r\n\r\nGet powerful ideas in minutes\u2014not hours or days with our summaries of today\u2019s most transformative books.\r\nWith <b>6,500+ key insight summaries</b> in audio or text, plus personal guidance through topics from our experts and curators, whatever you want to learn, you\u2019ll find it here.\r\n<b>29+ million</b> people already trust Blinkist to help them grow and maximize their potential and their time.\r\nJoin us and <b>learn smarter, not harder</b>.\r\n\r\n<b>GET THE KEY INSIGHTS FROM 6,500+ BESTSELLING BOOKS & PODCASTS</b>\r\n\u2022 Blinks: Read & listen to book summaries from top titles in 15 min\r\n\u2022 Shortcasts: Get to the heart of transformational podcasts\r\n\u2022 Sharpen your professional skills with the best business books & podcasts\r\n\u2022 Grow with the most impactful self-improvement titles\r\n\u2022 Discover new perspectives with bestsellers on economics, science, history & culture\r\n\u2022 Find inspiration with the latest trends & ideas in your professional field\r\n\r\n<b>GROW WHEREVER YOU ARE: ENJOY BOTH AUDIO & TEXT</b>\r\n\u2022 Listen to audio versions of our book insights to easily fit learning into your day\r\n\u2022 Learn hands-free at the gym, in the car, or doing chores with Autoplay\r\n\u2022 Download book & podcast key insights to listen offline\r\n\r\n<b>LEARN & GROW TOGETHER WITH BLINKIST SPACES</b>\r\n\u2022 Curate Spaces\u2014your learning playlists\u2014to organize toward your goals\r\n\u2022 Share your Spaces for FREE with anyone you want to learn with, even if they\u2019re not on Blinkist yet\r\n\r\n<b>ENJOY PERSONALIZED RECOMMENDATIONS & EXPERT-CURATED LISTS</b>\r\n\u2022 Always know what to read or listen to next\u2014we\u2019ll suggest titles based on your interests & goals\r\n\u2022 Let a pro lead you through today\u2019s must-know topics and apply what you learn right away with interactive tools and activities.\r\n\u2022 Discover new ideas & find motivation with recommended book lists curated by experts\r\n\r\n<b>BENEFIT FROM A PERSONAL TOUCH</b>\r\n\u2022 Focus only on top books\u2014our editorial team carefully selects every book\r\n\u2022 Listen to Blinks of Podcasts, made with the podcast creators for exclusive new insights\r\n\u2022 Enjoy lovingly written summaries of key ideas by experts with a passion for explaining complex topics in simple, beautiful language\r\n\r\n<b>IN THE PRESS</b>\r\n\"Blinkist is an intriguing new app that encourages you to read more nonfiction books... It\u2019s a fun and fascinating way to discover new and interesting topics\" -The New York Times\r\n\r\n\"There is no such thing as too much knowledge. If you would like to expand your horizons but don\u2019t have the time to read, Blinkist is a speedy and convenient way of learning\" -TheNextWeb\r\n\r\n\"Blinkist offers a terrific service\u2014great ideas distilled down to their very essence. For those of us who are deeply curious about new ideas on success, happiness, innovation, progress, and more, it\u2019s a great start.\" - Forbes\r\n\r\n<b>HOW WILL YOU LEVEL UP?</b>\r\nGetting started is simple. Download the Blinkist app now & sign up for a <b>free 7-day trial</b> with unlimited access. When you\u2019re ready, choose a monthly or annual plan!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda<b>6,500+ Book summaries & 27 categories to explore</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd16 <b>PERSONALIZED book recommendations from the Blinkist editors</b>\r\n\ud83e\udd1d <b>A free EXTRA PROFILE</b> on your account to share books with a friend\r\n\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfeb <b>Expert & curator led AUDIO GUIDES through today\u2019s must-know topics</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 <b>A NEW curated book every day</b> to easily fit learning into your routine\r\n\ud83d\udcd9 <b>READING LISTS with books from hundreds of topics</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <b>AUDIO versions of all key insights from books</b> \r\n\r\nIf you choose the Blinkist Basic plan you can still enjoy 1 title selected by us, every day. Ready to make headway? Download Blinkist today!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.blinkist.com/en/tos\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.blinkist.com/privacy.html\r\n\r\nQuestions? Suggestions? Speak to a real person at Blinkist! Our trusty customer support team is just an email away\u2014simply write to support@blinkist.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>A WORLD OF KNOWLEDGE IN YOUR POCKET</b><br><br>Get powerful ideas in minutes\u2014not hours or days with our summaries of today\u2019s most transformative books.<br>With <b>6,500+ key insight summaries</b> in audio or text, plus personal guidance through topics from our experts and curators, whatever you want to learn, you\u2019ll find it here.<br><b>29+ million</b> people already trust Blinkist to help them grow and maximize their potential and their time.<br>Join us and <b>learn smarter, not harder</b>.<br><br><b>GET THE KEY INSIGHTS FROM 6,500+ BESTSELLING BOOKS &amp; PODCASTS</b><br>\u2022 Blinks: Read &amp; listen to book summaries from top titles in 15 min<br>\u2022 Shortcasts: Get to the heart of transformational podcasts<br>\u2022 Sharpen your professional skills with the best business books &amp; podcasts<br>\u2022 Grow with the most impactful self-improvement titles<br>\u2022 Discover new perspectives with bestsellers on economics, science, history &amp; culture<br>\u2022 Find inspiration with the latest trends &amp; ideas in your professional field<br><br><b>GROW WHEREVER YOU ARE: ENJOY BOTH AUDIO &amp; TEXT</b><br>\u2022 Listen to audio versions of our book insights to easily fit learning into your day<br>\u2022 Learn hands-free at the gym, in the car, or doing chores with Autoplay<br>\u2022 Download book &amp; podcast key insights to listen offline<br><br><b>LEARN &amp; GROW TOGETHER WITH BLINKIST SPACES</b><br>\u2022 Curate Spaces\u2014your learning playlists\u2014to organize toward your goals<br>\u2022 Share your Spaces for FREE with anyone you want to learn with, even if they\u2019re not on Blinkist yet<br><br><b>ENJOY PERSONALIZED RECOMMENDATIONS &amp; EXPERT-CURATED LISTS</b><br>\u2022 Always know what to read or listen to next\u2014we\u2019ll suggest titles based on your interests &amp; goals<br>\u2022 Let a pro lead you through today\u2019s must-know topics and apply what you learn right away with interactive tools and 