<br>If you choose the Blinkist Basic plan you can still enjoy 1 title selected by us, every day. Ready to make headway? Download Blinkist today!<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.blinkist.com/en/tos<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.blinkist.com/privacy.html<br><br>Questions? Suggestions? Speak to a real person at Blinkist! Our trusty customer support team is just an email away\u2014simply write to support@blinkist.com",
